      "Lord, you have graven your people on your hands and you do not forget your promises. Make me a faithful keeper of the promises others have entrusted to my files. When I am tempted to treat record-keeping as merely administrative, remind me whose word I am preserving. Let me close this week as one who has remembered well on behalf of those who could not.",
